        "apiVersion": "hololab.dev/v1",
        "category": "reconstruction/colmap4d",
        "description": "Split a timed colmap4d model into camera, point and image components without rewriting IDs or times.",
        "docs": "Three fixed outputs, no parameters. All three are materialized even if disconnected; only downstream consumption is demand-driven. Uses colmap4d arrays and header readers, then independent byte-preserving copies. Requires the timed component profile (times, points_t, time_meta and image pixels). Does not certify full reciprocal tracks or time coverage; merge strict_validate can validate untrusted data.",
